            <div xml:id="m-d920932c-1bc8-40fa-bcf8-02e8e12846c5">
              <lg xml:id="m-589dcff8-464c-43d1-a41c-0ea120ce9705">
                <l xml:id="m-47138a04-dd15-4070-bf18-8e175a5fe4c2" facs="#m-8abf7644-4848-4e4d-b104-8ea64aaf4cb1" label="text-like">The Ascension of our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-5ff6a2aa-d6ef-45ee-bbdc-2085b084dc0f" facs="#m-5395a3a8-a4a3-4b86-8e05-a28cfbfdd7ec" label="ambiguous">840</l><l xml:id="m-e30ed6f4-6bfa-4ba3-b047-377a449b5798" facs="#m-02631210-bf0e-4b38-bcd3-e955190ce4c7" label="ambiguous">onert.</l><l xml:id="m-eb8a3169-9da4-4be2-85c4-250ed888f076" facs="#m-4e97fa15-b958-4d4f-bec0-6552710f81fd" label="ambiguous">i.</l><l xml:id="m-34fcee04-4110-4e6c-82d0-4a453026f9e2" facs="#m-dc49d01b-f684-4074-824a-2ea93a31c4ba" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-68f591a7-50e3-4c33-9710-2fd420d63fe4" facs="#m-15bb36a0-360f-4f7c-bf36-27b032b2c818" label="lyrics-like">-scéndit “Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f203995-c749-457e-8a12-7deae82f03a0" facs="#m-7bd8eee9-1956-45f0-9707-ba2d2f0d474f" label="ambiguous">in ju- bi- la- ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ea01a19-9304-4700-83ae-7f44ea734de1" facs="#m-8213f508-90c5-4778-b48b-0e59f41e316e" label="ambiguous">us</l><l xml:id="m-d4501078-17e9-48f1-a58b-ec1f63764ccd" facs="#m-1234d5af-0747-478c-a9d7-9d68e32ed43a" label="lyrics-like">6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-b4082259-a7e0-46fd-ac96-c82d472afe82" facs="#m-f3a37117-23ec-4bc6-9e2a-bf4c8652ddef" label="lyrics-like">Dó-mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-da47ee97-9ec2-42c5-a344-0081321cd3e7" facs="#m-063680b2-a613-43b4-a253-41bf6bf6b048" label="lyrics-like">in vó¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f252e1e-0ea0-4f0c-a2c7-eece5bb95077" facs="#m-ab766318-a836-4dea-9557-e4d9959857e5" label="ambiguous">nus</l><l xml:id="m-e052cf04-d64b-4657-89b6-50e28060dd3e" facs="#m-ad4c22c5-6377-441c-8ee3-af89ae44c6ce" label="lyrics-like">ce tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b3ea26d-232f-41fc-b51c-8e6d50aed6fb" facs="#m-d7f00070-af93-4cd0-8a78-69c3ac439aed" label="ambiguous">ne,</l><l xml:id="m-c8e15b36-b5e7-4c40-952b-418091230f32" facs="#m-781cbf31-5ad1-4205-86c9-b928ee7c9492" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-152eb361-9037-43c0-a79b-e514867be66e" facs="#m-8c42e8de-cf96-4818-a9a9-b087303ea29e" label="ambiguous">bae,</l><l xml:id="m-023f45cf-7ecd-4e5c-8fac-741277c85127" facs="#m-ecddc4bf-b364-4b23-a7ec-b693ac12e62a" label="ambiguous">al¬</l><l xml:id="m-b911603f-fd01-47c6-96d6-118057d70d56" facs="#m-ad08f238-fb4d-4b0d-a57c-a6f29fffd042" label="ambiguous">le¬</l><l xml:id="m-f5f108e6-739a-448e-afca-ae16de5ebd0f" facs="#m-15398ec2-ea2d-4b8c-9418-4ff7365c1297" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-b1f5dc19-65c2-4677-8597-428293cc4a32" facs="#m-90537b4a-940c-412d-96ae-371d4ddad973" label="lyrics-like">NUscipe, Dómine, múnera, quae lut a praeséntibus perículis liberé¬</l><l xml:id="m-f3a97db8-0b20-44c2-8f11-770a495e3360" facs="#m-0b42df9c-c7f6-4beb-aef9-7461e52d7e73" label="lyrics-like">O pro'Fsuii tui gloriósa Ascensió¬</l><l xml:id="m-990f17ce-710f-4d8c-a22d-cab14e863dab" facs="#m-fb21f0ac-ad14-450e-ba5b-2fb9be5b24bd" label="lyrics-like">mur, et ad vitam perveniámus</l><l xml:id="m-f6dc0173-b1c5-4949-b209-4ba23678d0ba" facs="#m-e7e94b60-20ba-4856-96eb-12d22612b03e" label="lyrics-like">ne deférimus: et concéde propstius; laetérnam. Per eúmdem.</l><l xml:id="m-a98d33ca-2f43-471c-949e-77729262a280" facs="#m-0990d0da-d73b-44a5-8ae0-af2c6ab8c59e" label="text-like">Preface of the Ascension, p. 9.</l><l xml:id="m-efa9b051-94a2-4eec-81c4-2dd67d45dc2d" facs="#m-fcf7ff86-da24-4ee3-98f0-43a6d1959009" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-5d0f393c-520b-447e-aee1-dbaddfee912c" facs="#m-fd9b9ae0-d034-4e86-bf56-7c2a52958f2d" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-98a9632b-646c-436b-990a-62393bcdbabd" facs="#m-c21329fc-314e-439d-966a-44e08b5a0476" label="lyrics-like">Sálli-te Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a6307eb-5f94-4959-bb7f-3458ac707ea4" facs="#m-b9080b36-d957-4176-9214-926216ba4af4" label="lyrics-like">no, qui ascéndit su¬</l><l xml:id="m-18b7d9b7-046b-46dd-a133-c71026089595" facs="#m-f53cfc41-ce6f-4bc6-bd07-b810fb48c130" label="ambiguous">per</l><l xml:id="m-bf1f8759-0ce6-4372-8422-c9096b9f153b" facs="#m-1bbda815-48c8-4e4f-ae49-616e3d2bf64c" label="lyrics-like">caé- los cae-ló- rum ad O-ri- éntem, alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4f2d5c7-627d-4c27-81d7-b13f0566d550" facs="#m-ede4acac-07bb-4a52-877a-8e5aef4aab94" label="lyrics-like">lú- ia.</l><l xml:id="m-45c5a60e-343b-46b1-ac9f-d678990a2f50" facs="#m-5b5b5f4c-e55d-4ac0-aa7c-71816989cafa" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-527ed58d-146b-4140-828d-48ec36c5cb62" facs="#m-d2b2a4a1-4a56-4f38-b922-3bfc24a3e4ce" label="lyrics-like">ORaesta nobis, quaésumus omni-] percépimus, invisibili consequámur</l><l xml:id="m-613e6f62-9bf4-48d8-a309-00bd2076d3d4" facs="#m-fec2463e-c403-46d7-ae7a-8a42de341552" label="lyrics-like">E potens et miséricors Deus: ut lefféctu. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-db37a7de-93df-4fbb-9f25-864b05937e96" facs="#m-758f1caf-781e-4ea1-94e8-91f01bf96eb2" label="lyrics-like">quae visibilibus mystériis suménda</l><l xml:id="m-1a2c3b4b-439a-443d-ad86-67fb0ec887c9" facs="#m-74dcde15-f2ed-4229-860c-6a7e168a33cc" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-4633da85-e9e7-4a23-a806-4cb4cf68d36e" facs="#m-5ac0d8f4-0523-4647-a33f-b3f1c9cc3712" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Elevátis mánibus. p. 851.</l><l xml:id="m-6253c955-09a1-49ac-aa1a-5aba6b15b65d" facs="#m-1c044eef-66f5-43b1-830e-b96ccb7a5581" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-47e1aa30-ed7e-4a03-8447-3db23324973f" facs="#m-f37ff6b1-a004-4cec-9b6e-7ab406ad15c5" label="ambiguous">Act. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-506c7219-1eaf-4f33-ba77-004393632378" facs="#m-f2357e84-b5e9-4eee-ae3e-05f58064f3e7" label="lyrics-like">(T convéscens, praecépit eis abl meum :* quia Joánnes quidem ba¬</l><l xml:id="m-542ffa41-0060-4366-8e29-cc2193feb7a5" facs="#m-77417e3e-bc76-47ad-be21-1dbf6f31bf71" label="lyrics-like">ptizávit aqua, vos autem baptizabi¬</l><l xml:id="m-00601d9a-cf04-4fe4-926c-1c05a7864ed9" facs="#m-f1579e0f-d058-4f46-9239-31738cad821d" label="lyrics-like">V Jerosólymis ne discéderent,</l><l xml:id="m-1e652e6a-82a6-4c47-8fcc-19abeb45b5bb" facs="#m-b34ca722-7d30-4897-a2cd-52ea222e4ec8" label="lyrics-like">sed exspectárent promissiónem Pa¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ebc64c0-0150-43b4-94d9-a358a98cc26e" facs="#m-fcca4eb7-620b-4665-a4b3-8e0a9147af87" label="ambiguous">mini Spiritu Sancto non post multos</l><l xml:id="m-f68b9fb3-e16c-4ad2-8fe9-03e7bd4bfbc8" facs="#m-618072b8-d459-4855-95a1-d2fd4c077b19" label="lyrics-like">tris, quam audístis (inquit) per osl hos dies.</l></lg>
            </div>
